  "properties": {
    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Investigate & Modify\r\n\r\nThis dragon’s eye should open whenever it’s awake or an intruder’s been detected — it only stays shut when nothing’s happening at all.  \r\n\r\n**Do This:**\r\n\r\nRun it and test a few different `Yes`/`No` combinations. Find the one where the eye doesn’t match what it should, then investigate and fix the logic.",
